    "body": "ZORR Three-Chat SHERIFF Hard Control R01.\n\nOWNER-approved universal law for CHAT A/B/C, implemented reuse-first on the existing studio bootstrap/orchestration + hq-validate path. No new daemon, archive, framework, workflow, image execution, merge, or production mutation.\n\nTDD phase at PR creation: RED only. Candidate contains approved design/plan plus `tests/test_three_chat_sheriff_law.py`; the shared law/validator/wiring are intentionally absent so hq-validate must fail for the new contract tests before implementation.\n\nBase at branch creation: `f67fd9454a6c2702e60b270634d934dc2ea62665` on `duncan/zorr-studio-r01`.\n\nDo not promote PASS until exact final HEAD has fresh hq-validate success and readback.",
